(:id "cpp/W2" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/cpptable/absent_payload_residue_test.go: TestCppAbsentPayloadResidueNotCopied, TestCppAbsentPayloadResidueNotCopiedNegativeControl, TestCppAbsentPayloadResidueNotCopiedOrderingNegativeControl" "test/tables/fixedform_properties.cpp") :tested-revision "6fc05433aacbc772246675d372a96adab1465a92" :note "2026-11-09: the C++ fixed read lands an absent optional's present flag and then, when the flag is 0, copies the DECLARED DEFAULTS over the payload (kTableFixedPresentDefaults, §3.4 IGNORED on read). The identity and compiled plans carry one such entry per optional, and both defer an unguarded present-defaults entry until after the guarded half, so a union-bearing absent payload cannot have its defaults overwritten by the arm entries' wire residue; a guarded present defaults entry (an optional inside an arm) keeps its guard and its place after its own payload. The property harness's optional/absent-payload-residue-is-copied KNOWN-RED is deleted, and the test stains the wire payload under an absent flag for both a plain and a union-bearing optional and proves they read the defaults. Its negative control removes the defaults copy from the emitted runtime and the probe goes red, and a second control lifts the emitted present-defaults plan row back over the guarded payload rows (the old unguarded-first coalescer) and the union-bearing probe goes red on the arm residue.")
(:id "cpp/R11" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/cpptable/fixedversioning_writer_bound_count_two_endpoints_test.go: TestFixedVersioningWriterBoundCountTwoRemotes") :note "2026-11-08 audit: holds; the old citation (fixedversioning_writer_bound_count_two_peers_test.go, TestFixedVersioningWriterBoundCountTwoPeers) no longer exists. The renamed test passes with SCHEMA_SLOW=1.")
(:id "text-bytes-flags-defaults/cpp/generation" :state :done :evidence ("compiler/valuedefaults_test.go: TestTableValueDefaultsCarriers, TestFixedTableValueDefaultsEveryLeg") :note "2026-11-08 audit: holds on main; the old citation was a line link at 8ea5ed8e.")

