(:id "vt/wstring/cpp" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/cpptable/vtcells_strict_test.go: TestCppVariableCellsStrict, TestCppVariableCellsStrictNegativeControl") :note "2026-11-09: an unpaired surrogate is not text and the write refuses (§16.14 W0) instead of writing U+FFFD; the gate reads the emitter source and the negative control removes the refusal spelling and requires the cell to go red.")
